">京</span><span begin="13.905" end="14.125">真</span><span begin="14.126" end="14.587">中</span></p><p begin="14.588" end="19.127" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.588" end="14.794">お</span><span begin="14.794" end="15.315">揃</span><span begin="15.315" end="15.540">い</span><span begin="15.540" end="16.250">の</span><span begin="17.377" end="17.738">思</span><span begin="17.738" end="18.020">い</span><span begin="18.020" end="18.191">出</span><span begin="18.191" end="18.362">っ</span><span begin="18.362" end="19.127">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些属于我们的共同回忆</span></p><p begin="21.819" end="27.143" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.819" end="22.171">不</span><span begin="22.171" end="22.594">透</span><span begin="22.594" end="22.969">明</span><span begin="22.969" end="23.782">で</span><span begin="24.757" end="25.709">難</span><span begin="25.709" end="25.856">し</span><span begin="25.856" end="26.167">い</span><span begin="26.168" end="26.432">よ</span><span begin="26.432" end="27.143">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是模糊不清 难以捉摸</span></p><p begin="29.268" end="32.940" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.268" end="29.859">今</span><span begin="29.859" end="30.027">ど</span><span begin="30.027" end="30.348">こ</span><span begin="30.348" end="30.587">で</span><span begin="30.587" end="31.300">何</span><span begin="31.300" end="31.540">し</span><span begin="31.540" end="31.796">て</span><span begin="31.796" end="31.942">る</span><span begin="31.942" end="32.195">の</span><span begin="32.195" end="32.356">か</span><span begin="32.356" end="32.440">な</span><span begin="32.441" end="32.525">?</span><span begin="32.525" end="32.525">っ</span><span begin="32.525" end="32.940">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你现在在哪里 又在做些什么呢？</span></p><p begin="33.083" end="36.620" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.083" end="33.339">ふ</span><span begin="33.339" end="33.595">と</span><span begin="33.595" end="33.979">声</span><span begin="33.979" end="34.148">聴</span><span begin="34.148" end="34.676">き</span><span begin="34.676" end="34.891">た</span><span begin="34.891" end="35.131">く</span><span begin="35.131" end="35.284">な</span><span begin="35.284" end="35.437">っ</span><span begin="35.437" end="35.589">た</span><span begin="35.589" end="35.868">り</span><span begin="35.868" end="36.155">し</span><span begin="36.155" end="36.620">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">偶尔会突然想听听你的声音</span></p><p begin="36.851" end="40.293" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.851" end="37.300">何</span><span begin="37.300" end="37.700">話</span><span begin="37.700" end="37.867">し</span><span begin="37.867" end="37.906">て</span><span begin="37.906" end="38.150">い</span><span begin="38.150" end="38.394">い</span><span begin="38.394" end="38.659">か</span><span begin="38.659" end="38.898">分</span><span begin="38.898" end="39.139">か</span><span begin="39.139" end="39.291">ら</span><span begin="39.291" end="39.531">な</span><span begin="39.531" end="39.683">く</span><span begin="39.683" end="39.779">な</span><span begin="39.779" end="39.875">っ</span><span begin="39.875" end="40.293">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却又不知道该和你说些什么</span></p><p begin="42.236" end="44.728" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.236" end="42.507">や</span><span begin="42.507" end="42.827">め</span><span begin="42.827" end="43.214">に</span><span begin="43.214" end="43.687">し</span><span begin="43.687" end="43.922">た</span><span begin="43.923" end="44.158">ん</span><span begin="44.158" end="44.728">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后还是只能作罢</span></p><p begin="44.728" end="46.462" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="44.728" end="44.879">(</span><span begin="44.879" end="45.088">You</span> <span begin="45.088" end="45.374">are</span> <span begin="45.374" end="46.462">forever)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（你永远都在）</span></p><p begin="46.463" end="48.261" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.463" end="46.696">あ</span><span begin="46.696" end="46.942">の</span><span begin="46.942" end="47.191">日</span><span begin="47.191" end="47.439">と</span><span begin="47.439" end="47.903">同</span><span begin="47.903" end="48.261">じ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如那一天</span></p><p begin="48.262" end="49.885" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="48.262" end="48.437">(</span><span begin="48.437" end="48.709">In</span> <span begin="48.709" end="49.037">my</span> <span begin="49.037" end="49.885">memories)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（留在我的记忆里）</span></p><p begin="49.886" end="52.254" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.886" end="50.269">夜</span><span begin="50.269" end="50.528">を</span><span begin="50.528" end="51.032">吸</span><span begin="51.032" end="51.536">い</span><span begin="51.536" end="51.764">込</span><span begin="51.764" end="51.965">ん</span><span begin="51.965" end="52.117">で</span><span begin="52.117" end="52.254">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将那夜色深深吸入</span></p><p begin="52.254" end="53.236" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="52.254" end="52.389">(</span><span begin="52.389" end="52.525">You</span> <span begin="52.525" end="52.813">are</span> <span begin="52.813" end="53.236">forever)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（你永远都在）</span></p><p begin="53.484" end="57.280" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.484" end="53.659">名</span><span begin="53.659" end="54.019">前</span><span begin="54.019" end="54.315">を</span><span begin="54.315" end="54.858">確</span><span begin="54.858" end="55.059">か</span><span begin="55.059" end="55.631">め</span><span begin="55.631" end="55.894">る</span><span begin="55.894" end="57.280">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次确认你的名字</span></p><p begin="58.862" end="1:02.427" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.862" end="59.479">同</span><span begin="59.479" end="59.775">じ</span><span begin="59.775" end="1:00.376">星</span><span begin="1:00.376" end="1:00.688">に</span><span begin="1:00.688" end="1:00.952">手</span><span begin="1:00.952" end="1:01.209">を</span><span begin="1:01.209" end="1:01.475">伸</span><span begin="1:01.475" end="1:01.731">ば</span><span begin="1:01.731" end="1:01.947">し</span><span begin="1:01.947" end="1:02.427">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着同一颗星星伸出手</span></p><p begin="1:02.659" end="1:06.129" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.659" end="1:03.188">同</span><span begin="1:03.188" end="1:03.468">じ</span><span begin="1:03.468" end="1:03.699">粗</span><span begin="1:03.699" end="1:04.129">相</span><span begin="1:04.129" end="1:04.385">に</span><span begin="1:04.544" end="1:04.976">笑</span><span begin="1:04.976" end="1:05.200">い</span><span begin="1:05.200" end="1:05.404">合</span><span begin="1:05.404" end="1:05.608">っ</span><span begin="1:05.608" end="1:06.129">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为着同样的糗事相视而笑</span></p><p begin="1:06.321" end="1:09.833" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.321" end="1:06.872">同</span><span begin="1:06.872" end="1:07.145">じ</span><span begin="1:07.312" end="1:07.832">影</span><span begin="1:07.832" end="1:08.121">に</span><span begin="1:08.273" end="1:08.496">浮</span><span begin="1:08.496" end="1:08.721">か</span><span begin="1:08.721" end="1:08.888">れ</span><span begin="1:08.888" end="1:09.022">ち</span><span begin="1:09.022" end="1:09.156">ゃ</span><span begin="1:09.156" end="1:09.290">っ</span><span begin="1:09.290" end="1:09.833">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因着同样的身影而欢欣雀跃</span></p><p begin="1:10.025" end="1:13.850" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.025" end="1:10.871">懐</span><span begin="1:10.871" end="1:11.503">か</span><span begin="1:11.503" end="1:11.995">し</span><span begin="1:11.995" end="1:12.233">い</span><span begin="1:12.233" end="1:12.897">風</span><span begin="1:12.897" end="1:13.106">と</span><span begin="1:13.106" end="1:13.337">行</span><span begin="1:13.337" end="1:13.850">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伴着怀念的风继续前行</span></p><p begin="1:13.850" end="1:17.325" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.850" end="1:14.041">ど</span><span begin="1:14.042" end="1:14.233">ん</span><span begin="1:14.233" end="1:14.570">な</span><span begin="1:14.570" end="1:15.129">道</span><span begin="1:15.129" end="1:15.425">を</span><span begin="1:15.578" end="1:16.009">歩</span><span begin="1:16.009" end="1:16.169">い</span><span begin="1:16.169" end="1:16.421">た</span><span begin="1:16.421" end="1:16.673">っ</span><span begin="1:16.673" end="1:17.241">け</span><span begin="1:17.241" end="1:17.325">?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们曾走过怎样的道路来着？</span></p><p begin="1:17.448" end="1:20.986" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.448" end="1:17.708">ど</span><span begin="1:17.708" end="1:17.968">ん</span><span begin="1:17.968" end="1:18.264">な</span><span begin="1:18.456" end="1:18.985">音</span><span begin="1:18.985" end="1:19.280">を</span><span begin="1:19.280" end="1:19.392">聴</span><span begin="1:19.392" end="1:19.682">い</span><span begin="1:19.682" end="1:19.930">て</span><span begin="1:19.930" end="1:20.166">た</span><span begin="1:20.167" end="1:20.403">っ</span><span begin="1:20.403" end="1:20.929">け</span><span begin="1:20.929" end="1:20.986">?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们曾听过怎样的声音来着？</span></p><p begin="1:21.138" end="1:24.833" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.138" end="1:21.386">ど</span><span begin="1:21.386" end="1:21.634">ん</span><span begin="1:21.634" end="1:21.925">な</span><span begin="1:22.093" end="1:22.605">夢</span><span begin="1:22.605" end="1:22.909">を</span><span begin="1:22.909" end="1:23.142">見</span><span begin="1:23.142" end="1:23.331">て</span><span begin="1:23.331" end="1:23.579">い</span><span begin="1:23.579" end="1:23.790">た</span><span begin="1:23.791" end="1:24.002">っ</span><span begin="1:24.002" end="1:24.738">け</span><span begin="1:24.738" end="1:24.833">?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们曾做过怎样的梦来着？</span></p><p begin="1:24.833" end="1:28.959" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.833" end="1:25.680">何</span><span begin="1:25.680" end="1:26.385">回</span><span begin="1:26.385" end="1:26.708">だ</span><span begin="1:26.708" end="1:27.031">っ</span><span begin="1:27.032" end="1:27.545">て</span><span begin="1:27.545" end="1:27.792">サ</span><span begin="1:27.792" end="1:28.008">ヨ</span><span begin="1:28.008" end="1:28.281">ナ</span><span begin="1:28.281" end="1:28.488">ラ</span><span begin="1:28.488" end="1:28.721">し</span><span begin="1:28.721" end="1:28.840">よ</span><span begin="1:28.840" end="1:28.959">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论多少次 都好好道别吧</span></p><p begin="1:28.959" end="1:32.440" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:29.113" end="1:29.345">You</span> <span begin="1:29.345" end="1:29.665">are</span> <span begin="1:29.665" end="1:30.752">forever</span> <span begin="1:30.752" end="1:31.129">in</span> <span begin="1:31.129" end="1:31.456">my</span> <span begin="1:31.456" end="1:32.440">memories</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（你永远留在我的记忆里）</span></p><p begin="1:32.584" end="1:36.101" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:32.727" end="1:32.967">You</span> <span begin="1:32.967" end="1:33.295">are</span> <span begin="1:33.295" end="1:34.515">forever</span> <span begin="1:34.515" end="1:34.882">in</span> <span begin="1:34.882" end="1:35.203">my</span> <span begin="1:35.203" end="1:36.101">memories</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（你永远留在我的记忆里）</span></p><p begin="1:36.269" end="1:39.764" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:36